Apostolos Doxiadis, Apostolos Doxiades, Christos H. Papadimitriou, Khristos Kh. Papademetriou, Annie Di Donna, Alekos Papadatos"‰
†O protos kai autoteles tomos enos megalou kuklikou ergou pou entassetai ste demiourgia suggrapheon opos o Zola, o Mpalzak, o Pomain Pollan. H trilogia tou Karagatse - pou perilambanei, ste sunekheia tou Kotzampase, to "Aima khameno kai kerdismeno" kai "Ta sterna tou Mikhalou" - eikhe perigraphei apo ton idio os <>.
Sto proto auto muthistorema tou kuklou, o suggrapheas tou Kitrinou Phakelou zontaneuei mia oloklere epokhe, ta khronia tes ellenikes epanastases, me ola ta paraleipomena tes klasikes istorias, proballontas kai pali -riza kai pege tes oles sullepses- to thema guro apo to opoio peristrephetai oloklero to ergo tou: te duname tou sexoualikou enstiktou kai ten epidrase tou pano ste diamorphose ton atomon kai ton koinonion. O Karagatses stenei mprosta mas enan olozontano kentriko eroa, ton Mikhalo Pouse, ton periphemo Kotzampase tou Kastropurgou, pou ginetai exomotes kai prodotes giati ton kuberna to aisthema tou eudaimonismou kai giati bazei pio psela ap' ola te zoe tou kai tis khares pou mporei na tou dosei."–
“First Canadian publication of the powerful debut novel from the author of Be Near Me.
Finalist for the Man Booker Prize, the International IMPAC Dublin Literary Award, and the Whitbread Award.
Hugh Bawn was a modern hero, a visionary urban planner, a man of the people who revolutionized Scotland's residential development after the Second World War. But times have changed. Now, as he lies dying in one of his own failed buildings, his grandson Jamie comes home to watch over him. The old man's final months bring Jamie to see what is best and worst in the past that haunts them all, and he sees the fears of his own life unravel in the land that bred him.
It is Jamie who tells the story of his family, of three generations of pride and delusion, of nationality and strong drink, of Catholic faith and the end of political idealism. It is a tale of dark hearts and modern houses, of three men in search of Utopia. A poignant and powerful reclamation of the past, Our Fathersis a deeply felt, beautifully crafted, utterly unforgettable novel."—
”Petaei o gaidaros; Petaei! Kai malista milaei. Mono omos me ton Gianne kai ten Eirene e allios ton Bania kai ten Ira, duo aderphia pou zoun me tous goneis tous exoristoi ste Moskha. Ena panino gaidouraki, doro tou theiou Platona apo ten Ellada, me ena phermouar sto stethos pou krubei mesa mia kokkine karamela, ten kardia tou, ginetai o akhoristos philos ton paidion ston opoio lene ola ta mustika kai tis skepseis tous. Me arkhego ten panexupne kai sophe Ira katastronoun ena megalo skhedio. Sten poreia omos tha allaxoun gnome..."£
 Taken from the poverty of her parents' home in Portsmouth, Fanny Price is brought up with her rich cousins at Mansfield Park, acutely aware of her humble rank and with her cousin Edmund as her sole ally. During her uncle's absence in Antigua, the Crawford's arrive in the neighborhood bringing with them the glamour of London life and a reckless taste for flirtation. Mansfield Parkis considered Jane Austen's first mature work and, with its quiet heroine and subtle examination of social position and moral integrity, one of her most profound."¨
¥Oi "Akubernetes Politeies" apartizontai apo treis tomous: "E leskhe" (1961), "Ariagne" (1962), "E nukhterida" (1965). E drase topotheteitai antistoikha sten Ierousalem, sto Kairo, sten Alexandreia. Ena muthistorema pou tithaseuei aristotekhnika mia kheimarrode istorike ule, dinontas anthropine phone sto epos kai sto drama tou B Pagkosmiou Polemou, ten ora pou krinotan to mellon ton laon kai paikhteke sta zaria e tukhe tes Elladas. Khare se poikiles anadromes, e trilogia zontaneuei kai progenesteres periodous, apo ton Mesopolemo, ton khloro paradeiso tes ephebeias me ta prota erotika skirtemata kapoion eroon, os ten palia Aigupto, anakalontas mnemes progonon. To ergo koruphonetai me ten exegerse tou Stratou kai tou Stolou, to kinema tou Aprile 1944 kai te dramatike katastole tou, eno, me ton epilogo tou g tomou, metapheromaste ste Thessalonike meta ton Emphulio, to 1954, opou akougetai ena sugklonistiko rekbiem gia tous khamenous agonistes.
Ostoso, o Tsirkas den egrapse khroniko, alla ergo tekhnes. Istorike akribeia kai phantasia spania denontai s' ena toso armoniko sunolo. Kinontas stibara megalous ogkous, katagraphei euaistheta tis apekheseis ton gegonoton ste suneidese kai stis skheseis ton anthropon, plathontas olozontanes morphes pou tha meinoun sto pantheon ton muthistorematikon eroon. Politikes mekhanorraphies, akhalinotes philodoxies mesa ste dine tou polemou, alla kai oraia oneira kai perisseuma anthropias kai gennaiotetas dinoun to stigma ton "Akuberneton Politeion", opou o erotas, kuriarkhos, tuligei kai xetuligei to nema mias sunarpastikes plokes. Parallela, me ten poluphonia tes aphegeses kai alles neoterikes tekhnotropies, o suggrapheas katorthonei na sugkhoneusei ton monternismo me ten paradose. Ena metaikhmiako ergo, pou sphragise ta ellenika grammata s' auto ton "suntomo 20o aiona"."ª

§
Ten anoixe tou 1909, o ekptotos soultanos Abdoul Khauit o B exorizetai ste Thessalonike kai uenei egkleistos se uia entuposiake epaule. Ekei, suuphona ue to uuthistoreua, tha diegeitai gia liges nukhtes s' ena uikro koritsi te zoe tou. Ena entekakhrono ouos agori kruphakouei... Ebdouenta khronia meta, tha uparkhei akoue uia nukhta, uallon uia zoe oloklere se uia uono nukhta. Alloste ston 20o aiona argouse sukhna na xeuerosei.
To Liges kai uia nukhtes, ue axona ten erotike istoria pou pholiazei sten kardia tes aphegeses, existorei uia peripeteia gia to kunegi tou ploutou kai ten anazetese tes eutukhias. To biblio anaplathei uia uageutike sunoikia exo apo ta teikhe tes Thessalonikes, aute ton Exokhon, pou esbese gia panta. Einai akoue uia graphe gia ta spitia, phtokhika kai plousia, gia to uesa kai to exo tous, gia tous toikhous kai ta epipla opou uphainontai oi anases zonton kai tethneoton. To Liges kai uia nukhtes euperiekhei akoue kata kapoion tropo ton skholiasuo tou, dierotatai piso apo ten kouinta gia ta agona khoraphia tes graphes, ta ergasteria tes, tis astokhies kai ta pathe tes, einai ue alla logia to koitagua tou idiou tou uuthistoreuatos ston kathrephte. Pera ouos kai pano ap' ola einai ena biblio gia ten anekesto blabe tes uparxes, auten pou prokalese o pio deuegertes aionas, o eikostos."²
¯E istoria tes Daphnes kai tou Tzonu einai mia alethine istoria, pou o suggrapheas ten ezese sten ephebeia tou "nukhta pros nukhta".
Ksetuligetai sto "Rits", ena kampare tou 51, me ta saxophona na skepazoun ton apoekho tou Emphuliou ki enan Amerikano axiomatiko na zei to romantiko tou pathos me mia amartole Ellenida -ten ora pou e kubernese Plastera upographei ten ektelese tou Mpelogianne.
Ola auta moiazoun na men ekhoun kamia skhese metaxu tous ki omos einai oi krikoi tes idias alusidas. E Daphne den exere tipota gia ten epokhe tes, alla kapoia stigme tha plerone to timema tes, me ton idio tropo pou to pleronan tote osoi amakhoi skotonontan apo adespotes sphaires.
E istoria tes moiazei se polla me ten istoria tes Noras, tou Stathe, tes Olgas, tou Leonida kai ton allon agrimion pou kuklophoroun guro tes, stis selides tou bibliou autou. Einai e khamene genia. E pio sosta, oi anupopsiastoi mias khamenes genias.
Oi <>einai to proto biblio tou Phrentu Germanou -to egrapse anamesa sta 17 kai sta 26 tou khronia, alla den to tupose giati den ebriske ekdote. "Tote nomiza oti egrapha diegemata", leei ston prologo tou. "Tora, blepontas to ap ten alle akre tou tounel, niotho oti egrapsa, pali, ena biblio epokhes. Mono pou edo oi eroes, ta istorika prosopa tou bibliou, einai anthropoi pou tous aggixa, sta 17 mou khronia, pou perpatesa dipla tous kai pou kapoia stigme skoupisa m ena manteli ta dakrua tous. Tote den eikhame akoma khartomantela..."Ä
Á(. . .) Den ekhei semasia an e threskeia ton progonon mas pethane e an ten edolophonese to skoteino Buzantio. . . Semasia ekhei oti toute e ge pou mas trephei kai pou pano tes eulogame ton semerino Theo, ekhei galoukhethei kai megalosei e idia me tous kampous, ta bouna, ta dase, ton ourano kai te thalassa tes, me ten marmarine threskeia ton pateron mas pou "prepei na ten xeroume prin apo kathe alle. Gia touto graphteke e Muthologia aute. To asteio tes eikhe ten skopimoteta na te kanei eukhariste kai okhi "skholastike". . . Kai, metaxu mas, m' aresei pou ten egrapsa . . ."È
ÅTa biblia einai epikinduna. Allazoun to pepromeno ton anthropon. Auto diapistonei e panepistemiake koinoteta tou Keimpritz otan e diakekrimene kathegetria tes Latinoamerikanikes logotekhnias, Mplouma Lennon briskei adoxo telos apo khtupema dierkhomenou autokinetou ten ora pou diaskhizei mia diastaurose tou Sokho, buthismene sten anagnose enos poiematos tes Emilu Ntikinson.
Liges ebdomades argotera, o diadokhos tes sten edra kai proen erastes tes paralambanei ena dema gia keinen apo ten Ourougouae, pou periekhei ena antitupo tes "Grammes skias" tou Tzozeph Konrant, me mia paraxene aphierose kai ikhne tsimentou sto exophullo.
E ereuna gia ten proeleuse tou bibliou metatrepetai se mia eis bathos exereunese tou kosmou tes anagnoses. Sta tessera taxidia tou protagoniste kai aphegete autes tes paraxenes istorias anamesa sto boreio kai sto notio emisphairio, to musteriodes antitupo tou apokaluptei siga siga mia krummene aletheia, tromaktike kai ousiastike..."Ö
ÓThis study of alternative and activist media provides an introduction to alternative media theories, audiences and practices. It brings diverse voices and concepts from outside the commercial media world to the fore, enriching and challenging mass media. Illustrated with historical and current examples, from both a UK and international perspective, it also includes carefully constructed exercises and discussion topics based on case studies and available texts.Topics include the place of alternative media in a mass-media world; a history of alternative and activist media; media participation and consumption by marginalised audiences; the use of pirate and community radio, video and television by community and minority groups; fanzines and other small publishing ventures by individuals; the use of alternative media for explorations in design; the blurring of boundaries between alternative and mass media; and new technology and its possibilities for alternative media."×
ÔTo sundromo ton sunoron einai ena eidos "arrostias", pou den uparkhei kan ston katalogo ton anagnorismenon psukhikon diatarakhon. To stokhastiko auto muthistorema mila akribos gia ten arrostia aute. Me duo diaphoretikes aphegematikes phones, mila gia ta sunora tou oloklerotismou, tes phuges, tes enokhes, tou erota, tes prosdokias, tes sunuparxes, tes adeias paramones. Gephuronei to atomiko me to sullogiko, dinontas phone s' olous tous metanastes pou thorakistekan ste siope tous.
Sto "Mikro emerologio sunoron" de sumbainei tipota to idiaitero - kai tautokhrona sumbainoun ta panta. O protagonistes aphegeitai tis ephta protes meres mias pareas Albanon metanaston sten Ellada stis arkhes tou '90. Einai mia aphegese opou to drama kai e tragodia sunuparkhoun me to mauro khioumor kai te lutrotike autoeironeia. Ena muthistorema pou mas thumizei epipleon pos se auto ton kosmo eimaste oloi metanastes, me mia prosorine adeia paramones pano se aute te ge, atherapeuta perastikoi."×
ÔMe kurio prosopo ten Isabella e Izampo ton Billardouinon, prosopo istoriko, kentriko gegonos ten katalepse tou phragkikou kastrou tes Kalamatas to 1293, apo Ellenes kai Slabous khorikous, kai istoriko plaisio ten polutarakhe epokhe tes Phragkokratias, o Aggelos Terzakes sunthetei ena khroniko eroismou kai agapes, ton kairo ton trobadouron, ton staurophoron, ton koursaron kai ton ippoton, sto proto xupnema tes psukhes tou neou ellenismou ton 13o aiona.
"E prigkipesa Izampo" einai to pio klasiko sten kataskeue keimeno tou Aggelou Terzake, organomeno me exairetike prosokhe kai ikanoteta, zontano, polukhromo, me therme sten aphegese, eulepto kai idiaitera endiapheron sten anagnose para ten ektase tou. Einai ena istoriko muthistorema, to opoio anaplathei zoera kai peistikotata mia toso makrine kai diaphoretike epokhe. [...] O suggrapheas askholeitai, esto emmesa, me ta diakhronika kentrika erotemata tes zoes, katathetontas ten pagia piste tou gia ten ousiastike tragikoteta tes zoes, kai idios gia te moiraia apolexe ton pio euaistheton kai axion anthropon.
(apo ten eisagoge tou Aggelou Aphroudake)"Ü
ÙMia gnesia peripeteia, opou oi kunegoi tou thesaurou edo den einai oi megaloi, alla ta paidia. Enas thesauros sten Aigina; Kai malista ste Bagia; Nai, ste Bagia, ekei pou eikhe "pantreutei" dodeka khronon ton Panagiote, tote sta 1936. Tora e Zoe einai pali sten Aigina, okhi paidi anemelo, okhi koritsi sten Katokhe, ma megale, apla megale.
"Oi diakopes xekinousan. O dekatetrakhronos Alexes me to Gallo philo tou kai te mikrotere aderphe tou paraponiotan gia to bareto kalokairi pou tha pernousan sten Aigina. Eutukhos omos erkhontai ki alloi episkeptes me ta paidia tous, anamesa tous kai e Nikol ki etsi ola allazoun. E Nikol ekhei analabei na sugkentrosei plerophories gia na boethesei ena Germano pou paskhei apo amnesia. E ereuna tes xekinaei apo te Bagia kai apo ten oikogeneia pou philoxenese to Germano sten Katokhe. Ta paidia anazetoun kapoio khameno thesauro sten periokhe kai para tis antirreseis ton gonion gia tous kindunous tes "apostoles" to polumekhano mualo tous, tous odegei ste luse: stis khamenes lires kai ston anektimeto thesauro, ma kai te philia, ten agape kai tis elpides gia to mellon.""â
ß"Ena pezographiko biblio pou ploutizei te neoellenike philologia einai to muthistorema "Astropheggia" tou k. I. M. Panagiotopoulou. Se diakosies penenta mia selides uparkhei e psukhographia enos kosmou me ta niata tou, pou anemodernetai kai autosuntribetai, pou agkaliazei to thanato, opos o Aggelos tou, pou "sekose ten kouberta isame to prosopo tou, ekrupse ta matia tou, me mia kinese ponemene, surtheke sto makros tou krebatiou* to kephali tou egeire sto maxilari. E metera den eniose tipote. T' astra basileuan"".
Mikh.Rodas, "E pneumatike zoe: O kosmos ton biblion"
"To Bema", Trite 25 Dekembriou 1945"ò
ïOs mikre autobiographia, to biblio auto aph'enos einai empotismeno me iatrikes leptomereies pou eidikoi kai me tha broun akros endiapherouses kai aph'eterou ekhei os kentriko thema kai menuma oti o Theos steketai piso apo kathe therapeia. Men perimenete bebaia oute phanatismous oute threskeutike katekhese. Aplos tha deite ten pepoithese tou suggrapheos oti piso apo kathe iatriko thauma e sumptose e anthropine kalosune brisketai e skia tou Theou.
PEGE:http://almurofustiki.com/pisw-mas-ste..."ó
ğO Basiles Seretes - autos pou argotera onomasan Mpil - pheugei mia zoe kunegemenos apo te mia pole sten alle, aphenontas piso tou omades kai proponetes. Atithasos, apistos, egoistes. Tis meres alonizei ta gepeda kai ta bradia, otan den kourniazei sta mpar, stronei pasientses. Enas anthropos mesa sto plethos kai gia auto monakhikos. Gepeda, xenodokheia, dromoi, xetuligontai me phonto te Thessalonike, to Bolo kai ten Athena. Se kathe mia apo autes kai mia gunaika.
Podosphairistes, phusiotherapeutes, paragontes, beteranoi enallassontai me mparobious, ippodromiakedes kai athletikous reporter. Pou anekei o Mpil; Ti krubetai kato apo te phanela tou; Pros ta pou khanetai parea me te xephtismene balitsa tou kai mia trapoula me gumnes; Giati pheugei panta me trena kai katoikei se domatia pou blepoun se stathmous;
"E Phanela me to ennia" - istoria enos anthropou pou apo ta eikosi os ta eikosi tria tou mesouranei mesa kai exo apo ta gepeda - einai to enato biblio tou suggraphea tes "Biotekhnias Ualikon"."ù
öTo biblio einai muthistorema mazi kai komiks, istoria kai muthoplasia, paramuthi kai dokimio. Mia parea philon ste sugkhrone Athena -pou den einai alle apo tous demiourgous tou bibliou-- prospathei tautokhrona na aphegethei kai na katalabei te megale peripeteia tes anazeteses ton Themelion ton Mathematikon, peripeteia pou semadepse anexitela ten epokhe mas. Einai arage, opos leei enas apo autous, mia istoria tragike, megethous malista arkhaias tragodias; E, opos pisteuei enas allos, mia entelos aisiodoxe periptose; Sto Logicomix, oi apostaseis katargountai. Kaluptontas mia diarkeia exi dekaetion, to biblio aphegeitai me teleios prototupo tropo ten epike istoria mias anazeteses tes opoias oi perissoteroi eroes plerosan baru timema gia te gnose, phtanontas sukhna mekhri ten trela. To rolo tou aphegete ekhei o pio sunarpastikos kharakteras tes istorias, o megalos mathematikos kai philosophos Mpertrant Rasel. Me base te dike tou zoe, blepoume ten istorias tes anazeteses ton Themelion mesa apo tis sunaisthematikes kataigides, ta dramatika istorika gegonota kai tis ideologikes diamakhes pou ten ethrepsan. Oi peripeteies ton megalon dianoeton pou protagonistoun sten anazetese, tou Phregke, tou Khilmpert, tou Pouankare, tou Bitgkentstain, tou Gkentel kai tou Tourignk, zontaneuoun mesa apo tis skheseis tous me ton Rasel kai te dike tou pathiasmene enaskholese ten anazetese, kai odegountai mesa apo te skhese tous mazi tou sten koruphose, pou sumpiptei me ten pio dramatike stigme sten istoria tou eikostou aiona."ı
úO erotas, e anazetese tou erota, o pothos tou erota... Tria kalokairia mesa sto lampro phos tes Attikes, treis adelphes sten anthese tous, e Maria, e Inphanta, e Katerina. E Maria, e megalutere, aisthesiake, konta sta musteria tes phuses, e Inphanta, phlogere alla sugkratemene mprosta ston erota, e Katerina, dipsasmene gia anexartesia, pou dialegei to oneiro. Gi' auten o muthos ginetai e pragmatikoteta, opos ta musteriode prosopa tes Polonezas giagias kai tou kapetaniou Andrea. E Katerina aphegeitai ta tria auta kalokairia me phantasia, khioumor kai aperante trupheroteta, me neanike khare pou ekhei kiolas enan tono nostalgias."ı
úNa oneireuesai, mou 'lege enas philos pou m'agapouse kai me exere kala. Ta oneira, sunethos, prodinoun. Paraplanoun. Kamia phora kai skotonoun. Omos, de ginetai na zeis khoris na oneireuesai. Den ekhei noema. Den ekhei ousia. Na oneireuesai! Koita mono na ekheis stamparei ten exodo kindunou apo ta oneira sou. Tote sozesai. Kai poia einai e exodos kindunou; Tipote den einai ste zoe to
pan! Ekhei kai parakato, ekhei kai allo. Prokhora, loipon, xekolla!
Aute einai e exodos kindunou! Otan enas anthropos ekhei endosei entelos sto pathos tou, einai mataio na prospatheis na tou allaxeis taktike. Einai opos akribos o tzogos. Oso khaneis, toso kollas. Ekhei mia perierge gluka e autokatastrophe. Anekei sta sklera narkotika. An ethisteis, mallon teleioses. Ektos an
petukheis stis kales tou to Theo. Sumbainei. Ego ta eikha brei mia
khara me te zoe. Giname kolletaria kai ta pernousame periphema. Pegaina os ekei pou m'epairne. Gia na khairomai. Ki an eikha kephi, prokhorousa os ekei pou de m'epairne. Gia na mathaino."€
ı
Mpaineis se demosia uperesia kai zetas eugenika na ta kaneis ola poutana. E kopela stis plerophories se stelnei sto grapheio 314 ston trito oropho, opou gria upallelos milaei sto telephono. Epikheireis na te diakopseis, apotugkhaneis, deka lepta argotera kleinei to telephono kai se rotaei tsantismene an perases prota apo to protokollo, esu les okhi me apologetiko uphos, gria se stelnei protokollo, meta grapheio 5, meta tameio kai sto telos pali edo. Pas protokollo, thlimmene upallelos graphei arithmo se khartaki kai sou to dinei khoris na se koitaxei pote. Pegaineis grapheio 5, pairneis khartaki proteraiotetas, perimeneis 45 lepta, erkhetai e seira sou, antras upallelos me bromere maskhale se rotaei poios se esteile edo, den thumasai, upallelos brizei aorista, alla telos panton, sou kanei te khare na se exuperetesei. Les eukharisto khoris na uparkhei logos, katebaineis sto tameio, terastia oura, rotas ton teleutaio "gia na ta kanete ola poutana perimenete;", sou gnephei kourasmena nai, pernane ores, erkhetai mesemeri, to tameio kleinei, oi polites diamarturontai, oi upalleloi lene oti den phtaine ekeinoi, ta parapona sas ston upourgo. Polites pheugoun brizontas kai tha xanaerthoun aurio na stethoun apo tis 6 to proi sten oura, giati e prothesmia gia na ta kaneis ola poutana legei methaurio. Telos tes istorias.
Sumperasma: Den einai autos o sostos tropos gia na ta kaneis ola poutana."␀␀p@"	
